      "relation": "new",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "claim": "If the holder never reads its inbox before the goal is released and later concluded, the board still sends this machine one 'was not delivered' note about the original ask. The design accepts this: D13 cures finding 448 by checking the current claim before sending, and the in-flight gate makes sends rarer still. It is now at most one note per blocking period, not one per ready goal, so it does not block this commit.",
